  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program for Rural Development and Family Agriculture, PRODAF</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Desarrollo Rural y Agricultura Familiar, PRODAF</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo es contribuir a los ingresos de productores agropecuarios de la Agricultura Familiar, mediante el aumento de la productividad.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is to increase the income of family farmers by increasing productivity.</narrative>
  </description>
